{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BerriAI/litellm/pulls/45935","id":4817668962,"node_id":"PR_kwDOKALCgc8AAAABHyfLYg","html_url":"https://github.com/BerriAI/litellm/pull/45935","diff_url":"https://github.com/BerriAI/litellm/pull/45935.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/BerriAI/litellm/pull/45935.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BerriAI/litellm/issues/45935","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BerriAI/litellm/pulls/45935/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BerriAI/litellm/pulls/45935/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BerriAI/litellm/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BerriAI/litellm/issues/45935/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BerriAI/litellm/statuses/7cd5407e5b82578c5570383ca86a7dc80952ee16","number":45935,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(guardrails): restore supported_decisions_providers on stable/1.104.x so Add Guardrail settings load","user":{"login":"devin-ai-integration[bot]","id":158243242,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCW6Zqg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/811515?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/devin-ai-integration","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## TLDR\n\nProblem this solves:\n\n- The decisions backport (#45906) broke Add Provider Guardrail settings on stable/1.104.x\n- `GET /guardrails/ui/add_guardrail_settings` returns 500 with an ImportError on every call\n- The Admin UI guardrail wizard gets no providers, so nobody can add one from the dashboard\n\nHow it solves it:\n\n- Imports the providers helper from `litellm.decisions.call`, where the backport moved it\n- Restores its public name `supported_decisions_providers`, matching rc/1.105.0 and main\n- Points the existing regression test at the same module\n\n## User Flow\n\nBefore: an admin opening the Add Provider Guardrail wizard on a stable/1.104.x proxy sees an empty provider list\n\n1. They open http://localhost:4000/ui/?page=guardrails and click Add Guardrail\n2. The dashboard calls GET http://localhost:4000/guardrails/ui/add_guardrail_settings\n3. The proxy answers 500 `Internal server error`, so the wizard has no providers to pick\n\nAfter: the same wizard loads its providers\n\n1. They open http://localhost:4000/ui/?page=guardrails and click Add Guardrail\n2. The same GET returns 200 with the guardrail settings, including the decision model providers\n3. The wizard lists providers and the guardrail can be created\n\n## Affected release\n\nRegression on stable/1.104.x since #45906\n\n## Pre-Submission checklist\n\n- [x] I have added meaningful tests\n- [x] The handful of test files covering my change pass locally, e.g. `uv run pytest tests/unit/<your_test_file>.py -v`. Leave the suites (`make test-unit-*`, `make test-unit`) to CI: it finishes in ~15 minutes where a laptop takes an hour or more\n- [ ] My PR passes all required CI/CD checks (e.g., lint, schema.d.ts sync check, etc.)\n- [x] My PR's scope is as isolated as possible; it only solves 1 specific problem\n- [ ] I have received a Greptile **Confidence Score of at least 4/5** before requesting a maintainer review (Greptile reviews automatically once the PR is opened; only comment `@greptileai` to re-request a review after pushing changes)\n\n## Screenshots / Proof of Fix\n\nSame config on both sides: `model_list: []` and a master key from the environment, no database. Before runs the stable/1.104.x tip on port 4101 and After runs this branch on port 4102. The endpoint makes no provider call, so there is no provider spend\n\n### Before (0939a839e9)\n\n1. `curl -s -w '\\nHTTP %{http_code}\\n' -H \"Authorization: Bearer $LITELLM_MASTER_KEY\" http://localhost:4101/guardrails/ui/add_guardrail_settings`\n2. Output\n\n```\n{\"error\":{\"message\":\"Internal server error\",\"type\":\"internal_server_error\"}}\nHTTP 500\n```\n\n3. Proxy log\n\n```\nImportError: cannot import name 'supported_decisions_providers' from 'litellm.decisions.main'\n```\n\n### After (7cd5407e5b)\n\n1. The same curl against port 4102\n2. Output is HTTP 200 with the full settings payload, and `decision_model_providers` reads\n\n```\n['openai', 'openrouter', 'azure_ai', 'perplexity', 'typesafe', 'strands_decider', 'cloudflare', 'hosted_vllm']\n```\n\n## Type\n\n🐛 Bug Fix\n\n## Final Attestation\n\n- [x] The tests check the right things, including the edge cases, and regressions in the respective real-world customer use-cases are not possible after this PR\n\n<!-- CURSOR_SUMMARY -->\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> **Low Risk**\n> Narrow import-path and symbol rename fix for guardrail UI settings; no changes to auth, billing, or decision API runtime behavior beyond restoring the listing endpoint.\n> \n> **Overview**\n> Fixes a **stable/1.104.x regression** where `GET /guardrails/ui/add_guardrail_settings` failed with an `ImportError` because the proxy still imported `supported_decisions_providers` from `litellm.decisions.main` after the decisions backport moved that logic.\n> \n> **`supported_decisions_providers`** is now defined and exported from `litellm.decisions.call` (renamed from the private `_supported_providers`), and the guardrail UI endpoint plus its regression test import it from there. The Add Guardrail wizard can load `decision_model_providers` again instead of returning 500 with an empty provider list.\n> \n> <sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit 7cd5407e5b82578c5570383ca86a7dc80952ee16. Bugbot is set up for automated code reviews on this repo. Configure [here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\n<!-- /CURSOR_SUMMARY -->","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-11T08:17:49Z","updated_at":"2026-10-11T08:32:26Z","closed_at":"2026-10-11T08:32:23Z","merged_at":"2026-10-11T08:32:23Z","merge_commit_sha":"1f90f482d1f84bd898d40335779ccc7fa975412e","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"BerriAI:litellm_fix_decisions_import_stable_1_104_x","ref":"litellm_fix_decisions_import_stable_1_104_x","repo":{"id":671269505,"node_id":"R_kgDOKALCgQ","name":"litellm","full_name":"BerriAI/litellm","owner":{"login":"BerriAI","id":121462774,"node_id":"O_kgDOBz1f9g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121462774?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BerriAI","html_url":"https://github.com/BerriAI","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BerriAI/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BerriAI/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BerriAI/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BerriAI/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BerriAI/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BerriAI/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BerriAI/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BerriAI/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BerriAI/received_events","type":"